Package: kaliclean
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: wickednull <wickednull@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtwebchannel, python3-pyside6.qtwebenginecore, python3-pyside6.qtwebenginewidgets, sudo
Recommends: desktop-file-utils, hicolor-icon-theme
Description: Frosted-glass system hygiene utility for Kali Linux
 KaliClean is a desktop utility for reclaiming disk space and memory on
 Kali Linux. It offers ten carefully scoped cleanup targets, live RAM,
 swap and disk gauges, and an iOS-style glass interface.
 .
 Privileged operations are authenticated in-app with sudo; the password
 is kept only in process memory and is never written to disk. No telemetry
 or network calls are made.
Homepage: https://github.com/wickednull/KaliClean
